{'symbol': 'ADSK', 'date': '2023-05-08 09:00:00', 'title': 'AUTODESK INTRODUCES FORMA FOR NEXT-GENERATION BUILDING DESIGN IN THE CLOUD', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO , MAY 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AUTODESK, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: ADSK) TODAY UNVEILED THE FIRST SET OF CAPABILITIES OF AUTODESK FORMA, AN INDUSTRY CLOUD THAT WILL UNIFY WORKFLOWS ACROSS THE TEAMS THAT DESIGN, BUILD AND OPERATE THE BUILT ENVIRONMENT. FORMA'S INITIAL CAPABILITIES TARGET THE EARLY-STAGE PLANNING AND DESIGN PROCESS WITH AUTOMATIONS AND AI-POWERED INSIGHTS THAT SIMPLIFY EXPLORATION OF DESIGN CONCEPTS, OFFLOAD REPETITIVE TASKS, AND HELP\xa0EVALUATE ENVIRONMENTAL QUALITIES SURROUNDING A BUILDING SITE, GIVING ARCHITECTS TIME TO FOCUS ON CREATIVE SOLUTIONS."}